["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">論文</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ろんぶん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">论文；论著；论述；文章</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"112366\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>について<ruby>論文<rp>(</rp><rt>ろんぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他写了一篇关于这个主题的论文</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">輪</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">圆环；圆圈；环；箍；圆箍；轮；车轮；圈子；朋友圈；行星环</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"226723\">お<ruby>父<rp>(</rp><rt>とう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんは<ruby>煙草<rp>(</rp><rt>たばこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>煙<rp>(</rp><rt>けむり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でたくさん<ruby>輪<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>作<rp>(</rp><rt>つく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">爸爸可以吹出很多烟圈。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/1365909\" title=\"Tatoeba · tsayng\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · tsayng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ワイン</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">葡萄酒</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231361\">あのおいしいワインをなぜ<ruby>飲<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まないんだい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">为什么不尝尝那美味的酒?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">別れ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わかれ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">分别；离别；告别；分手；（恋人或夫妻）分开；关系破裂</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"185457\"><ruby>会<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うは<ruby>別<rp>(</rp><rt>わか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れの<ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>め。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">见面是分开的</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">わがまま</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">自私；利己主义者；任性；随心所欲；蛮横</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"90316\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>決<rp>(</rp><rt>けっ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してわがままではない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她绝对不是自私的</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">脇</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">腋下；臂下；侧面；侧翼；旁边；身边；靠近；邻近；一旁；偏离；置之一隅；离题；题外；配角；助演；次要角色；联句中的第二句</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"120727\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がブリーフケースを<ruby>脇<rp>(</rp><rt>わき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>抱<rp>(</rp><rt>かか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えてやってくるのが<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我看见他带着手提箱过来了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">分ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">分割；分开；分离；分类；分出；分享；分配；分给；分发；区分；区别；辨别；区隔；劝阻；调停；制止（打斗）；打成平手；战成平局；挤过；穿过（人群）；售出；卖出</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"176861\"><ruby>君<rp>(</rp><rt>きみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>夢<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>現実<rp>(</rp><rt>げんじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>分<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けることができないのか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你不能把幻想和现实分开吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">わざと</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">故意；有意；刻意</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"120658\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がわざとそうしたとも<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他不可能是故意这样做的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">僅か</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わずか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">少量；少许；微小；轻微；狭窄的（差距）；仅仅；只是；不过；不超过</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"187165\"><ruby>夏休<rp>(</rp><rt>なつやす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みまであとわずか<ruby>一週間<rp>(</rp><rt>いっしゅうかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">还有一周就放暑假了。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/349289\" title=\"Tatoeba · zhouj1955\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · zhouj1955\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">話題</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わだい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">话题；主题；备受关注的；热议的；新闻热点</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"206007\">その<ruby>話題<rp>(</rp><rt>わだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う<ruby>価値<rp>(</rp><rt>かち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个问题值得讨论。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">笑い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わらい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">笑；笑声；微笑；笑容；冷笑；嘲笑；情趣用品；春宫图</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"226066\">ぎこちない<ruby>笑<rp>(</rp><rt>わら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いをした<ruby>店員<rp>(</rp><rt>てんいん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>答<rp>(</rp><rt>こた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">滑稽的男职员回答说</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">割る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">分割；除（数）；切割；切开；分成两半；分离；分开；撕裂；打破；弄碎；击碎；稀释；冲淡；降至…以下；低于；打折；折价；跨越；越过</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"195710\">マイケルは<ruby>皿<rp>(</rp><rt>さら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>割<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってしまった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">迈克尔打破了盘子。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">悪口</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わるくち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">坏话；谩骂；诋毁；中伤；恶言；骂人话</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">我々</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">われわれ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">我们</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216245\">しかし<ruby>我々<rp>(</rp><rt>われわれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なしで<ruby>続行<rp>(</rp><rt>ぞっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">但是,我们没有他。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">湾</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">湾；海湾</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141363\"><ruby>川<rp>(</rp><rt>かわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>山<rp>(</rp><rt>やま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って<ruby>湾<rp>(</rp><rt>わん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>注<rp>(</rp><rt>そそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いでいる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">河水从山上流到下面的海湾</span></div></li>"]